      "created_at": "2015-09-04T20:06:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Suppose you have 4 screws in your hand. You buy a card that costs 4 screws. Clearly you cannot buy another card. But can you still build a card from your hand? The rule book does not say otherwise, so we've been playing that you can.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Why wouldn't you be able to?</p>",
