      "raw": "<p>Because in most deck building games that I&#39;ve played, those cards would have been considered to be already &quot;used up&quot; for the turn. A strict reading of the rule book indicates that you can still use them, but a confirmation would be nice.</p><p>Another thing I noticed was the rule book specifies the requirements for purchasing twice in a turn, but not for purchasing 3 or 4 times. It would make sense that the total screw cost of <strong>all</strong> cards purchased may not exceed the total amount of screws in your hand. But by a strict reading of the rules, that&#39;s not the case.</p>",
